records inconsistent with the defined schema; this mismatch remains an open release blocker.*\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"open the task to build a central audit trail system for track redact activ across the pipelin 2026 07 11 bob loader refactor activ refactor the document loader to prepar for stream input ahead of hash and audit captur 2026 08 05 bob sha 256 hash activ ad sha 256 hash of input stream becaus the audit design requir an input hash alongsid the redact map 2026 08 15 bob audit schema definit activ defin the companion json audit schema hash redact map need befor cli wire 2026 09 10 bob cli integr activ wire audit log generat into the cli path now that the schema wa defin to satisfi the releas gate 2026 09 18 diana audit verifi mismatch activ verif found the cli emit audit record inconsist with the defin schema this mismatch remain an open releas blocker\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e96d1e408a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-26-Audit-Trail-Logging.md\", \"id\": \"a015962ae73f1229\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.3096670416214726, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.11542317088781805, \"vector_similarity\": 0.76290274, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-26-Audit-Trail-Logging.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e96d1e408a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-26-Audit-Trail-Logging.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-26-Audit-Trail-Logging.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 2011, \"chunk_count\": 2, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:02:38\", \"token_count\": 759, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-30\\n\\n# Document: High-DPI-Coordinate-Misalignment-Repro\\n\\n**Owner**: Charlie\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2030\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-09-02 (retrospective, covers 2026-08-17)\\n\\n## Test Logs\\n\\nReproduction notes for the high-DPI coordinate misalignment reported for CIPH-46, first reproduced 2026-08-17.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-30\\n\\n# Document: High-DPI-Coordinate-Misalignment-Repro\\n\\n**Owner**: Charlie\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2030\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-09-02 (retrospective, covers 2026-08-17)\\n\\n## Repro steps\\n\\n1. Open a PDF on a display reporting a scale factor above 1.0 (tested at 150% and 200%).\\n\\n2. Compare the redaction preview overlay's reported box coordinates against the coordinates the rendering library reports for the same region.\\n\\n3. At scale factors above 1.0, the overlay box is offset from the actual text region, with the offset growing as scale factor increases.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-30\\n\\n# Document: High-DPI-Coordinate-Misalignment-Repro\\n\\n**Owner**: Charlie\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2030\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-09-02 (retrospective, covers 2026-08-17)\\n\\n## Result\\n\\nThe misalignment reproduces consistently at both tested scale factors. It does not reproduce at 100% scale.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-30\\n\\n# Document: High-DPI-Coordinate-Misalignment-Repro\\n\\n**Owner**: Charlie\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2030\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-09-02 (retrospective, covers 2026-08-17)\\n\\n## Status\\n\\nRoot cause has not been isolated as part of this reproduction pass; this note only establishes that the defect reproduces and under which display conditions.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src gdoc 30 document high dpi coordin misalign repro owner charli document key doc 2030 last updat 2026 09 02 retrospect cover 2026 08 17 test log reproduct note for the high dpi coordin misalign report for ciph 46 first reproduc 2026 08 17 sourc id src gdoc 30 document high dpi coordin misalign repro owner charli document key doc 2030 last updat 2026 09 02 retrospect cover 2026 08 17 repro step 1 open a pdf on a display report a scale factor abov 10 test at 150 and 200 2 compar the redact preview overlay s report box coordin against the coordin the render librari report for the same region 3 at scale factor abov 10 the overlay box is offset from the actual text region with the offset grow a scale factor increas sourc id src gdoc 30 document high dpi coordin misalign repro owner charli document key doc 2030 last updat 2026 09 02 retrospect cover 2026 08 17 result the misalign reproduc consist at both test scale factor it doe not reproduc at 100 scale sourc id src gdoc 30 document high dpi coordin misalign repro owner charli document key doc 2030 last updat 2026 09 02 retrospect cover 2026 08 17 status root caus ha not been isol a part of this reproduct pas this note onli establish that the defect reproduc and under which display condit\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e99d1d8e8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-02-High-DPI-PDF-Rendering-Fixes-Review.md\", \"id\": \"a55699b32432c8bc\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.3090023975370615, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.13600083933865928, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7126727, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-02-High-DPI-PDF-Rendering-Fixes-Review.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e99d1d8e8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-02-High-DPI-PDF-Rendering-Fixes-Review.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-02-High-DPI-PDF-Rendering-Fixes-Review.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 987, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:01:58