d tree befor releas an initi audit led to swap the pdf parser librari but the task wa reopen when the replac parser turn out to be agpl licens the team is now search for an apach mit licens altern clickup task ciph 40 sourc id src cu ciph 40 task id ciph 40 titl audit third parti licens befor releas status activ reopen assigne diana prioriti high date creat 2026 08 08 activ histori 2026 08 08 alic task creat open open the task for a licens complianc review ahead of releas 2026 08 15 charli apach mit search activ reopen search for an apach mit licens altern pdf parser after the task wa reopen when the replac parser turn out to be agpl licens\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e9703e908a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-40-License-Compliance-Review.md\", \"id\": \"944c8567f386bf1b\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.503127331150328, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.3526801045004687, \"vector_similarity\": 0.85417086, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-40-License-Compliance-Review.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e9703e908a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-40-License-Compliance-Review.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-40-License-Compliance-Review.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1155, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:02:35\", \"token_count\": 555, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-24\\n\\n# Third-Party License Inventory Report\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2024\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-21 (retrospective, covers 2026-08-09; notes status through 2026-08-15)\\n\\nRetrospective report on the third-party license audit under CIPH-40.\\n\\n## Scope of the 2026-08-09 inventory\\n\\nAn audit of the dependency tree was run to catalog every third-party license in use ahead of release, flagging anything more restrictive than a permissive license.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-24\\n\\n# Third-Party License Inventory Report\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2024\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-21 (retrospective, covers 2026-08-09; notes status through 2026-08-15)\\n\\nRetrospective report on the third-party license audit under CIPH-40.\\n\\n## Finding and immediate action\\n\\nThe PDF-parsing dependency's license was flagged as a concern, and the team swapped it for a different parser library as a direct result of this inventory.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-24\\n\\n# Third-Party License Inventory Report\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2024\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-21 (retrospective, covers 2026-08-09; notes status through 2026-08-15)\\n\\nRetrospective report on the third-party license audit under CIPH-40.\\n\\n## Status as of 2026-08-15\\n\\nBecause this report is written retrospectively on 2026-08-21, it can note the later developments: the replacement parser adopted from the 08-09 finding was swapped in on 2026-08-11, then the task reopened on 2026-08-12 when that replacement turned out itself to be AGPL-licensed, which is not acceptable for the shipped dependency set. By 2026-08-15 the team was searching for an Apache- or MIT-licensed alternative; that search had not concluded as of this writing.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-GDOC-24\\n\\n# Third-Party License Inventory Report\\n\\n**Owner**: Diana\\n\\n**Document Key**: DOC-2024\\n\\n**Last Updated**: 2026-08-21 (retrospective, covers 2026-08-09; notes status through 2026-08-15)\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src gdoc 24 third parti licens inventori report owner diana document key doc 2024 last updat 2026 08 21 retrospect cover 2026 08 09 note status through 20