clud event the user believ were never be record the logger wa patch to a no op backend when opt out close that gap befor the flag semant were final sourc id src gdoc 51 privaci design note telemetri opt out flag semant owner diana document key doc 2051 last updat 2026 09 06 verif retrospect a network trace on 2026 08 24 confirm zero outbound telemetri traffic onc the opt out flag is set close the cli side verif a complet sourc id src gdoc 51 privaci design note telemetri opt out flag semant owner diana document key doc 2051 last updat 2026 09 06 remain limit the third parti electron crash report sentri ha not been audit for whether it independ respect the opt out environ variabl or requir it own disabl hook for minidump upload note cli side telemetri opt out is verifi full privaci complianc for air gap opt out user can not be claim until the sentri crash report path is audit separ\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e9e43bb08a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-06-Telemetry-Opt-Out-Design-and-Compliance-Check.md\", \"id\": \"c3381a6a564a6c9c\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.3575175836964205, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.16687085956631503, \"vector_similarity\": 0.80235994, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-06-Telemetry-Opt-Out-Design-and-Compliance-Check.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e9e43bb08a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-06-Telemetry-Opt-Out-Design-and-Compliance-Check.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-09-06-Telemetry-Opt-Out-Design-and-Compliance-Check.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1587, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:00:54\", \